  "body": "Offering a thoughtful combination of modern comfort, generous space and practical family living, this well-designed two-level home presents an excellent opportunity in the growing Milldale community. Set on an approximately 587sqm section with an approximately 209sqm floor area (as shown on the consented plans), the property features four bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, two living areas and a double internal-access garage. Complete with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, it offers added peace of mind for its future owners.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a separate lounge welcomes you into the home, providing a comfortable setting for relaxing or entertaining guests. Moving further inside, the open-plan kitchen and dining area offers a bright and inviting space for everyday family life. The kitchen features a central island, generous bench space and practical storage, while a heat pump ensures year-round comfort. Sliding doors connect the dining area to the Kwila deck, creating an ideal setting for outdoor dining and weekend gatherings.\r\n\r\nAlso on this level, the master bedroom provides a private retreat, featuring a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and its own heat pump. A separate guest toilet adds everyday convenience, while the double internal-access garage comes with EV charger pre-wiring, offering a practical feature for modern living.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the lower ground floor accommodates three additional bedrooms, a family bathroom and a second sitting area with its own heat pump. This additional living space is ideal for teenagers, family activities or simply enjoying some quiet time away from the main living areas. A convenient study nook provides a dedicated space for homework or working from home, while a laundry nook adds further practicality.\r\n\r\nSituated in the sought-after Millwater community, this home enjoys a convenient location surrounded by excellent lifestyle amenities. Families will appreciate the proximity to KingsWay School, Silverdale School and Orewa College, while Silverdale Mall, Northern Arena and local supermarkets make everyday shopping and recreation effortless. Beautiful Orewa Beach, scenic estuary walkways and easy motorway access further enhance the appeal, offering a wonderful balance of coastal living and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nCombining a practical two-level layout with three heat pumps, versatile living spaces and modern conveniences, this home is well suited to families looking for comfort, functionality and room to grow.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and discover what this home has to offer!",
